comments.body:
Thanks for the issue, it does seem like an oversight indeed since the documentation says
> If ‘auto’, early stopping is enabled if the sample size is larger than 10000 or if X_val and y_val are passed to fit

@Chaptyziok as the original reporter, are you interested in opening a PR?

@Chaptyziok please open a dedicated PR for this specific problem. You will need to add a regression test for this as well. Probably there is an existing test that can be updated.

> I think it is very simple, so maybe it can be combined with something else.

The simpler/smaller the PR, the easier it will be to get it reviewed and merged. There is no need to combine it with anything else, it can even be counter-productive 😉.
